-       row  `Note(rect, contents, open, dictionary)`  `/Text`, a sticky note  its `/Contents`, and whether it is shown `/Open`
-       row  `Widget(rect, fieldName, dictionary)`  `/Widget`, a form field's appearance  the field's `/T` name
-       row  `Other(subtype, rect, dictionary)`  any other `/Subtype`  the subtype, by name
